# ── Incident ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create incident for inventory (step 1 of agent workflow)
POST {{OpsDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/incident/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inventory DB replication lag causing order failures",
  "description": "Replication lag on inventory-db-02 has exceeded 30s, causing stale reads on the order placement flow. Orders placed in the last 10 minutes may reflect incorrect stock levels.",
  "severity": "high",
  "reportedBy": "ops-agent@contoso.com"
}

###

### Create incident for auth
POST {{OpsDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/incident/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Elevated latency on token refresh endpoint",
  "description": "P99 latency on /auth/token/refresh has risen to 4.2s over the last 15 minutes. Users are experiencing intermittent login failures.",
  "severity": "medium",
  "reportedBy": "ops-agent@contoso.com"
}

###

### Notify owner for incident (step 2 of agent workflow — replace INC-00001 with actual number)
POST {{OpsDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/incident/INC-00001/notify

###

### Create incident for unknown system (404)
POST {{OpsDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/incident/unknown
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test",
  "description": "Test description",
  "severity": "low",
  "reportedBy": "ops-agent@contoso.com"
}

###
